    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61178" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κω</span></b> , v.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πω</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῷα</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῷος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				111.3
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωαί:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστράγαλοι</span>, <i><span class="en">
