			</span></i> (ante <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώϊον</span>, fort.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶια</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωάζω</span></b> , 
