			, Id. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεχυράζω</span>
			, Id. (also in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιάζω</span>).</div>
